WEBVTT

00:02.380 --> 00:05.210
<i>I'm not the type of guy
who scares easily. You know me.</i>

00:07.010 --> 00:10.010
<i>But now that we've reached
the second part of the Grand Finals,</i>

00:10.180 --> 00:12.470
<i>the Ultimate Prize has gone
to their alien heads...</i>

00:14.310 --> 00:17.350
<i>Our ex-pal
"Prince double-crosser" most of all!</i>

00:20.730 --> 00:22.270
<i>I'm not going to give up.</i>

00:22.440 --> 00:24.900
<i>I'd do anything
for the Earth team...</i>

00:25.820 --> 00:27.400
<i>...and for Molly.</i>

00:27.820 --> 00:30.410
<i>But that's another story.</i>

01:49.570 --> 01:52.400
OK, Aikka, it's now or never.

02:00.200 --> 02:01.460
Here goes nothing.

02:06.840 --> 02:07.880
Great.

02:12.300 --> 02:13.470
Some magic portal.

02:28.820 --> 02:30.360
I don't even recognize you.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.510
What?

03:26.620 --> 03:28.040
Bingo! It's here.

03:39.510 --> 03:41.970
You're not going to give me
the slip that easily, Prince.

03:55.360 --> 03:57.860
That's not really
what I had in mind.

04:05.330 --> 04:06.620
Where am I?

04:08.540 --> 04:11.880
What do you mean, nowhere?
She's the pilot, remember?

04:14.210 --> 04:16.130
Go find her, now!

04:20.680 --> 04:23.050
As if the race
wasn't worry enough.

04:44.990 --> 04:47.370
This is really not good.

05:24.530 --> 05:26.580
OK, big girl,
pull yourself together.

05:26.870 --> 05:28.120
It's just a little dark in here,

05:28.290 --> 05:30.580
and there are some
seriously weird sounds.

05:54.060 --> 05:55.690
You shot us down
in the last race.

05:56.820 --> 05:58.940
You think we're thrilled
to chat with you?

06:04.610 --> 06:05.370
|whispers] Aikka...

06:06.780 --> 06:09.490
Say your prayers.
You won't leave here alive.

06:09.950 --> 06:12.080
The race is the race.

06:13.080 --> 06:15.460
I didn't ask you here to have tea.

06:15.630 --> 06:17.290
We are here to form
a temporary alliance

06:17.460 --> 06:19.420
against a common enemy.

06:20.010 --> 06:23.430
Out of all the racers,
Sul is the most powerful,

06:23.590 --> 06:25.890
as well as the most unpredictable.

06:26.090 --> 06:27.010
Sul.

06:27.300 --> 06:30.770
I want the Ultimate Prize.
I'm ready to risk everything for it.

06:30.930 --> 06:32.850
Who among you will join me?

06:37.650 --> 06:39.320
If Sul is allowed to win again,

06:39.480 --> 06:41.440
none of us will catch him
in the rankings.

06:41.610 --> 06:43.900
The race will be
essentially over.

06:44.860 --> 06:47.120
We must take Sul down
for good...

06:47.740 --> 06:49.200
Today.

06:57.170 --> 06:59.000
I want the Prize
as bad as you do.

07:02.090 --> 07:04.300
And I will follow Ning
wherever she goes.

07:07.840 --> 07:09.510
It will be close.

07:09.680 --> 07:11.890
But the four of us
might just make it.

07:14.810 --> 07:16.350
Then it is decided.

07:16.770 --> 07:18.270
Let none of us break this pact

07:18.440 --> 07:20.860
until Sul has been eliminated
from the race.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.190
Agreed.

07:24.690 --> 07:27.820
And I believed someone
was forcing your hand.

07:27.990 --> 07:29.660
I've been so naive.

07:29.950 --> 07:31.830
You're worse than all of them.

07:37.830 --> 07:38.920
Who goes there?

07:39.580 --> 07:40.250
<i>Molly?</i>

08:04.280 --> 08:06.950
You scared me to death.
Don't ever do that again.

08:07.110 --> 08:09.240
I'm way past my prime, you know.

08:09.490 --> 08:10.620
What are you doing here?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.740
This is the Avatar's temple.

08:12.950 --> 08:16.370
I'm simply doing
my daily rounds. And you?

08:17.160 --> 08:18.420
Listen, I heard a voice!

08:19.120 --> 08:20.130
Shh.

08:22.790 --> 08:24.750
Get us out of here!

08:29.880 --> 08:30.680
Please?

08:31.470 --> 08:33.050
Now that's more like it.

08:33.220 --> 08:36.770
The magic word opens
many a door, my dear.

08:38.890 --> 08:39.980
Like this one here.

08:57.200 --> 08:59.710
Welcome to my humble abode.

09:04.380 --> 09:05.340
Charming.

09:05.670 --> 09:07.420
After you've rested,
take the portal

09:07.590 --> 09:11.180
under the Earth team's logo,
and you'll be back in a flash.

09:12.180 --> 09:14.010
Perfect, thanks.

09:14.350 --> 09:16.470
Oh, but where are my manners.

09:17.100 --> 09:19.020
I'm sure you'd like
a hot drink before you go.

09:20.390 --> 09:23.480
These old stone walls
are death.

09:27.570 --> 09:31.360
We must take Sul down
for good... today.

09:35.410 --> 09:36.910
Sui's portal.

09:37.080 --> 09:38.750
Ah, there it is.

09:39.250 --> 09:40.870
I rarely have visitors.

09:41.040 --> 09:43.540
Now where are those dried frogs.

09:44.210 --> 09:45.250
Ah, here they are.

09:45.420 --> 09:48.250
You're going to love these.
They are delicious.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.350
<i>I can't let them do this.</i>

10:00.520 --> 10:01.850
Come and get it.

10:02.560 --> 10:03.650
Wait, that's not...

10:05.520 --> 10:07.400
...your portal.

10:21.250 --> 10:22.250
Hello?

10:28.630 --> 10:29.670
Anybody home?

10:40.970 --> 10:43.230
I came here to warn you.

10:43.480 --> 10:45.900
A group of racers are
preparing an ambush.

10:48.190 --> 10:50.610
They will hurt you, badly.

10:50.820 --> 10:52.070
This is serious.

10:53.900 --> 10:55.780
Are you listening to me?

10:57.030 --> 10:58.580
Why are you telling me this?

10:59.740 --> 11:01.410
Well, it's pretty obvious.

11:01.580 --> 11:03.620
Do you think I'd just
stand by and watch?

11:04.660 --> 11:07.420
And why not.
You'd have everything to gain.

11:08.210 --> 11:11.050
Don't you long to win
the Ultimate Prize as much as I?

11:12.260 --> 11:13.420
Yes.

11:14.760 --> 11:16.760
But I will not let it destroy me.

11:17.050 --> 11:19.260
Are you absolutely sure?

11:20.260 --> 11:21.100
What are you doing?

11:26.810 --> 11:27.560
Mother?

11:29.730 --> 11:30.770
Stop it!

11:36.700 --> 11:37.820
Stop!

11:39.160 --> 11:40.700
Your scars are so deep.

11:40.870 --> 11:42.080
They control you.

11:42.240 --> 11:44.120
It makes you an easy target.

11:45.710 --> 11:46.920
Your visit was an error.

11:47.120 --> 11:48.540
You have wasted my time.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.960
I welcome a surprise attack.

11:51.130 --> 11:54.170
It would break up the monotony
of this competition

11:54.590 --> 11:56.590
and maybe that of my existence.

11:57.590 --> 11:59.510
Why do you want
to win the Prize?

11:59.760 --> 12:01.720
I'm the master
over time, space,

12:01.890 --> 12:03.470
and even the course of destiny.

12:04.310 --> 12:06.560
There's nothing left
for me to wish for.

12:07.940 --> 12:08.850
Go.

12:16.440 --> 12:20.320
Well, if you're so bored,
why don't you just get lost?

12:21.160 --> 12:23.200
Leave the Prize to those
who really need it.

12:23.370 --> 12:24.330
We won't miss you.

12:36.420 --> 12:38.300
Molly? Are you crazy?

12:38.510 --> 12:40.680
Don Wei has been worried
out of his mind.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.550
Where have you been
all this time?

12:43.300 --> 12:45.060
I'm not sure anymore.

12:45.430 --> 12:46.850
Come on, let's hit it.

12:47.230 --> 12:48.480
Yeah, <i>uh...</i>

12:57.570 --> 12:59.860
Well, I guess we're racing today
after all, young lady.

13:00.070 --> 13:02.490
We'll discuss your little
disappearing act later, miss.

13:05.660 --> 13:07.500
For now,
let's focus only on the race.

13:07.660 --> 13:09.910
There are only three races left
before the end of the competition.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.080
We need points badly.

13:11.500 --> 13:14.420
And watch out for Sul.
We can't let him increase his lead.

13:14.920 --> 13:16.420
I'm aware of that.

13:32.940 --> 13:34.150
Keep heading
in that direction.

13:34.310 --> 13:35.940
You should see
the first gate soon.

13:57.210 --> 13:59.050
Get rid of Sul.

14:17.190 --> 14:19.190
What's going on here?
They're going the wrong way.

14:20.440 --> 14:22.030
Nothing we should worry about.

15:06.610 --> 15:07.950
Victory is mine!

15:10.450 --> 15:11.910
Looks like someone
is taking a bad beating.

15:19.170 --> 15:20.380
I can't do this!

15:21.710 --> 15:23.510
Molly, what are you doing?

15:23.920 --> 15:25.630
Picking up a hitchhiker.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.510
What is she talking about?

15:29.180 --> 15:30.600
I knew she'd crack
sooner or later.

15:31.140 --> 15:32.560
Molly, turn around!

15:32.770 --> 15:34.270
This is not your battle!

15:40.820 --> 15:41.520
<i>Sun?</i>

15:46.700 --> 15:48.030
WOW!

15:54.580 --> 15:59.130
Again, destiny has been altered.

16:05.420 --> 16:08.050
Now that you've seen it
for yourself, leave at once!

16:46.960 --> 16:48.840
Sui's pyramid just disappeared!

16:49.550 --> 16:50.380
What?

16:51.180 --> 16:53.680
Hey, it's back,
but way off limits.

16:53.970 --> 16:56.350
Huh? That's impossible.
Check it again.

17:24.590 --> 17:26.250
No, it couldn't be.

17:27.760 --> 17:30.420
Are you the one
they call Canaletto?

17:31.550 --> 17:35.100
Your reputation
honors you, Sul.

17:35.260 --> 17:38.350
Your knowledge is impressive,
and your powers

17:39.020 --> 17:41.940
far greater
than you let others believe.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.650
What do you want from me?

17:46.860 --> 17:48.320
What was that?

17:48.690 --> 17:49.990
I don't know, sir.

17:50.570 --> 17:53.490
We're picking up some kind
of magnetic interference.

17:55.660 --> 17:58.120
I underestimated you, Sul.

17:58.370 --> 18:00.250
That was a mistake.

18:00.710 --> 18:03.460
The light of your strength blinds

18:03.620 --> 18:05.460
my vision of the future...

18:05.710 --> 18:09.630
A future I've taken
great care to control.

18:10.550 --> 18:14.390
And this has to end.

18:15.260 --> 18:16.850
What do you plan
to do about it?

18:17.850 --> 18:21.430
I'm offering you
a rare alliance.

18:22.180 --> 18:26.860
Imagine, two great beings
standing together.

18:27.020 --> 18:29.730
We would be magnificent.

18:30.570 --> 18:33.200
Alliances are
for the small and weak.

18:33.360 --> 18:34.820
If you are truly Canaletto,

18:35.570 --> 18:38.910
then you have no real powers
over this world... not yet.

18:42.500 --> 18:46.330
You are making
a grave mistake.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.670
Begone, Canaletto.

19:03.890 --> 19:05.810
I am disappointed.

19:06.020 --> 19:08.940
I didn't expect you
to give up so easily.

19:30.840 --> 19:32.300
A transdimensional portal!

19:32.510 --> 19:35.970
I'm not as powerless
as you believe.

19:36.130 --> 19:38.640
Why did you think
I brought you here?

19:49.440 --> 19:52.020
It's really you. Canaletto.

19:57.200 --> 20:01.200
The hour is near, Satis.

20:02.240 --> 20:04.620
You have no right to be here!

20:05.160 --> 20:07.670
Return from whence you came!

20:08.170 --> 20:10.420
My time has come.

20:35.650 --> 20:38.320
Ah. Canaletto...

20:38.570 --> 20:40.490
What have you done?

20:50.830 --> 20:52.080
Molly, watch out!

21:06.770 --> 21:09.190
I'm sorry.
I lost to Aikka.

21:09.640 --> 21:12.610
I guess that means
we didn't score... again.

21:12.860 --> 21:15.440
You're in third place,
not fourth place.

21:16.030 --> 21:17.280
We scored some points.

21:18.150 --> 21:21.160
-Sul is gone.
-What, he's gone?

21:21.530 --> 21:22.870
What do you mean, gone?

21:23.450 --> 21:26.540
I mean he's no longer
part of this competition.

21:27.620 --> 21:29.040
We're waiting for you.
